        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CP-3701, Simple Beaded Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nRK International's Beaded Cabinet Pull is available in six finishes so you will be able to find the perfect match for your decor. Choose from a 5 inch, 8 inch, or 12 inch center to center lengths. This beaded middle vertical pull comes packaged with the necessary mounting hardware. It is a great way to add classic beauty to any home.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/beaded-middle-door-pull-rk-international-ph-4701\"><b>Beaded Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CP-3701 Traditional Beaded Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>RKI-CP-3701:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 5-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>RKI-CP-3702:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 8-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>RKI-CP-3703:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 12-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-TSR25_size.gif?v=1704354575\" width=\"600\" height=\"133\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
